{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "你提供的矩阵状态是仅 log1p 归一化值、没有原始计数来源，因此不能直接作为已发表 scVI 模型的输入。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": ["user:matrix_state"]
    },
    {
      "text": "已发表的 scVI 模型明确以原始计数数据作为输入，并在模型内部包含归一化过程。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 4,
          "quote": "scVI takes raw count data as input and includes an effective normalization procedure that is integrated into its model."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "原始计数输入是 scVI 的显式要求，而不是可选的执行门槛；这属于科学/接口层面的要求。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 4,
          "quote": "scVI takes raw count data as input and includes an effective normalization procedure that is integrated into its model."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "scVI 支持批次整合和低维表示，但这一能力声明不意味着它适用于你当前的 log1p 归一化矩阵。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "The original scVI model explicitly supports batch integration. No comparative superiority is asserted."
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "The original scVI model explicitly supports dimensionality reduction. No comparative superiority is asserted."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "模型在批次注释可用时会以批次注释为条件；你已提供 batch_key=donor，但仅凭这一点不能弥补缺少原始计数的问题。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 5,
          "quote": "The distribution is conditioned on the batch annotation bn of each cell (if available), as well as two additional, unobserved random variables."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": ["user:batch_key"]
    }
  ],
  "clarification": null
